@PSI1.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5158

### Sėkminga registracija
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Registracija su tuo pačiu email patikrai dėl case-insensitive
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "TEST@GMAIL.COM",
  "username": "testuser2",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Registracija su tuo pačiu username patikrai dėl case-insensitive
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kitas@gmail.com",
  "username": "TESTUSER",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Netinkamas email formatas
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser",
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Per trumpas password
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pvz@gmail.com",
  "username": "pvzuser",
  "password": "123"
}

### Sėkmingas prisijungimas
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Neteisingas slaptažodis
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "blogas_slaptazodis"
}

### Neregistruotas email
POST {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tokionera@gmail.com",
  "password": "testpass"
}

### Galimų kalbų sąrašas (viešas endpoint'as)
GET {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages

### Kalbos pasirinkimas - reikalauja JWT iš /api/auth/login atsakymo
# Pakeisk {{token}} į Token reikšmę, gautą prisijungus.
PUT {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages/select
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "language": "Lithuanian"
}

### Kalbos pasirinkimas be JWT - turi grąžinti 401
PUT {{PSI1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages/select
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "Lithuanian"
}